    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\qt0004_450f15e1f40b.png\"/><br/>A body of mass 1 kg is suspended with the help of two strings making angles as shown in figure. Magnitude of tensions $T_1$ and $T_2$, respectively, are (in N) :"
