  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0004_b30a12f4fcae.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{T}_1=\\mathrm{mg} \\cos 30^{\\circ} \\\\ & \\mathrm{T}_2=\\mathrm{mg} \\sin 30^{\\circ}\\end{aligned}$"
